Subject: [PATCH] EE timing: Timer 3 H-blank pacing, idle checkpoints and timer
 polling

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0002: IOP heap base and EE Timer 3 start
- 0043: Skip EE timer and event work between interrupts
- 0044: Pace the game by Timer 3 scan lines, PAL rates and host time
- 0046: Let a polling guest see every timer count
